    "diff_hunk": "@@ -26618,6 +26510,129 @@ document.body.appendChild(wbr);</code></pre>\n   </div>\n \n \n+  <h4>API for <code>a</code> and <code>area</code> elements</h4>\n+\n+<pre><code class=\"idl\">interface mixin <dfn interface>HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils</dfn> {\n+  [<span>CEReactions</span>, <span data-x=\"xattr-ReflectSetter\">ReflectSetter</span>] stringifier attribute USVString <span data-x=\"dom-hyperlink-href\">href</span>;\n+};</code></pre>\n+\n+  <dl class=\"domintro\">\n+   <dt><code data-x=\"\"><var>hyperlink</var>.<span data-x=\"\">toString()</span></code></dt>\n+   <dt><code data-x=\"\"><var>hyperlink</var>.<span subdfn data-x=\"dom-hyperlink-href\">href</span></code></dt>\n+   <dd>\n+    <p>Returns the hyperlink's URL.</p>\n+\n+    <p>Can be set, to change the URL.</p>\n+   </dd>\n+  </dl>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>The <dfn attribute for=\"HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils\"><code\n+  data-x=\"dom-hyperlink-href\">href</code></dfn> getter steps are:</p>\n+\n+  <ol>\n+   <li><p><span>Reinitialize url</span>.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li><p>Let <var>url</var> be <span>this</span>'s <span\n+   data-x=\"concept-hyperlink-url\">url</span>.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li><p>If <var>url</var> is null and <span>this</span> has no <code\n+   data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-href\">href</code> content attribute, return the empty string.\n+\n+   <li><p>Otherwise, if <var>url</var> is null, return <span>this</span>'s <code\n+   data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-href\">href</code> content attribute's value.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li><p>Return <var>url</var>, <span data-x=\"concept-url-serializer\">serialized</span>.</p></li>\n+  </ol>\n+  </div>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>The <span>HTML element insertion steps</span> for <code>a</code> and <code>area</code>\n+  elements, given <var>insertedNode</var>, are:</p>\n+\n+  <ol>\n+   <li><p>If <var>insertedNode</var> is not <span>connected</span>, then return.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li><p><span>Consider speculative loads</span> given <var>insertedNode</var>'s <span>node\n+   document</span>.</p></li>\n+  </ol>\n+  </div>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>The <span>HTML element removing steps</span> for <code>a</code> and <code>area</code> elements,\n+  given <var>removedNode</var> and <var>oldParent</var>, are:</p>\n+\n+  <ol>\n+   <li><p>If <var>oldParent</var> is not <span>connected</span>, then return.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li><p><span>Consider speculative loads</span> given <var>oldParent</var>'s <span>node\n+   document</span>.</p></li>\n+  </ol>\n+  </div>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>The <span>HTML element moving steps</span> for <code>a</code> and <code>area</code> elements,\n+  given <var>movedNode</var>, are:</p>\n+\n+  <ol>\n+   <li><p><span>Consider speculative loads</span> given <var>movedNode</var>'s <span>node\n+   document</span>.</p></li>\n+  </ol>\n+  </div>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>The following <span data-x=\"concept-element-attributes-change-ext\">attribute change\n+  steps</span>, given <var>element</var>, <var>localName</var>, <var>oldValue</var>,\n+  <var>value</var>, and <var>namespace</var>, are used for all <code>a</code> and <code>area</code>\n+  elements:</p>\n+\n+  <ol>\n+   <li><p>If <var>namespace</var> is not null, then return.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li><p>If <var>oldValue</var> equals <var>value</var>, then return.</p></li>\n+\n+   <li>\n+    <p>If <var>localName</var> is <code data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-href\">href</code>, then <span\n+    data-x=\"concept-hyperlink-url-set\">set the url</span> given <var>element</var>.</p>\n+\n+    <p class=\"note\">This is only observable for <code data-x=\"blob protocol\">blob:</code> URLs as\n+    <span data-x=\"url parser\">parsing</span> them involves a <span>Blob URL Store</span> lookup.</p>\n+   </li>\n+\n+   <li><p>If <var>localName</var> is <code data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-href\">href</code>, <code\n+   data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-referrerpolicy\">referrerpolicy</code>, or <code\n+   data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-rel\">rel</code>, then <span>consider speculative loads</span> given\n+   <var>element</var>'s <span>node document</span>.</p></li>\n+  </ol>\n+  </div>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>To <span>update <code>href</code></span> for <code>HTMLAnchorElement</code> and\n+  <code>HTMLAreaElement</code>, set the element's <code data-x=\"attr-hyperlink-href\">href</code>\n+  content attribute's value to the element's <span data-x=\"concept-hyperlink-url\">url</span>, <span\n+  data-x=\"concept-url-serializer\">serialized</span>.</p>\n+  </div>\n+\n+  <div algorithm>\n+  <p>The <code>HTMLAnchorElement</code> and <code>HTMLAreaElement</code> <span\n+  data-x=\"concept-hyperlink-url-set\">set the url</span> algorithm, runs these steps:</p>",
